\title{reactableduckdb: Serve 'reactable' Tables from Lazy 'DuckDB' Queries}
\description{
Streams a lazy 'duckplyr' or 'dbplyr' query backed by 'DuckDB' into a 'reactable' widget through reactable's custom server-side data backend API. DuckDB performs all filtering, counting, sorting, and pagination; R only ever materializes a zero-row schema prototype, a scalar filtered count, and the requested page of rows. Unsupported behaviour errors loudly instead of silently falling back to eager execution.
